                    coach_r1_banked:        `<strong>That's banking the banked.</strong> You picked the easiest segment to grow user count — but most of them already had a bank account. You could add 600,000 users and still reach only ~70,000 previously-excluded Nigerians. That does not release the NGN 4.5B tranche; it looks like you dodged the mandate.`,
